<DocsLayout title="Echophi — Common errors">
  <h1>Common errors</h1>
  <p>
    Partner APIs return a stable envelope with <code>error.code</code> and HTTP status. Full tables:{" "}
    <a href="/docs/status-codes">Status codes</a>.
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <code>401 unauthorized</code> — missing/invalid API key
    </li>
    <li>
      <code>403 forbidden</code> — missing permission
    </li>
    <li>
      <code>400 invalid_filter_field</code> / <code>invalid_event</code> / <code>invalid_api_version</code> —
      webhook registration contract
    </li>
    <li>
      <code>422 validation_error</code> — malformed JSON or bad URL
    </li>
    <li>
      <code>429 rate_limited</code> — slow down; honor <code>Retry-After</code>
    </li>
    <li>
      <code>502 bad_gateway</code> — Test delivery to your URL failed
    </li>
  </ul>
</DocsLayout>
